<title>USA: Lehman has $1.9 bln in equity issues ahead.</title>
<headline>Lehman has $1.9 bln in equity issues ahead.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc chairman and chief executive Richard Fuld said the company has $1.9 billion in lead-managed transactions in its current forward equity calendar.</p>
<p>Lehman has $6.8 billion planned in its forward fixed income calendar, Fuld said in a statement.</p>
<p>He also said that decisions by issuers to delay scheduled underwritings hurt its third quarter revenues.</p>
</text>
